    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hosheya mwenye jwa ku Isalaeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hosheya mwanace jwa Ela ŵajinjile ucimwene wa ku Isalaeli ku Samaliya, mcaka ca 12 ca ucimwene wa Ahasi mwenye jwa ku Yuda. Nipo ŵalamulile kwa yaka msano ni mcece. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwalakweju ŵatesile yindu yakusakala, ya kwalemwecesya AMBUJE,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " nambo ngaŵa mnope mpela muŵatendele ayimwene ŵane ŵa ku Isalaeli, ŵiŵalamulilaga cilamboco, jwalakwe mkanajinjile ucimwene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shalimanesa mwanace jwa Tigilati Pilesa mwenye jwa ku Asiliya, ŵajile kutenda ngondo ni Aisalaeli. Nipo Hosheya ŵalambile kwa jwalakwejo, nipo ŵaliji mkukoma msongo kwa Shalimanesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo caka cine Hosheya ŵakanile kukoma msongo ŵa pa caka kwa mwenye jwa ku Asiliya, ŵaŵendile So Mwenye jwa ku Iguputo kuti amkamucisye kumjimucila mwenye jwa ku Asiliya. Mwenye jwa ku Asiliya piŵajipikene nganiji, ŵamtaŵile Hosheya, ni ŵamŵisile mu ukayidi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Konasika kwa msinda wa Samaliya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Salimanasa ŵajile kuputa ngondo ku Isalaeli kwa yaka yitatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mcaka ca msano ni mcece ca ucimwene wa Hosheya, mwenye jwa ku Asiliya ŵawusumwile msinda wa Samaliya, ni ŵajigele Aisalaeli kwatyosya kumangwawo ni ŵajawile nawo ku Asiliya. Ŵaŵisile Aisalaeli ŵane mu msinda wa Hala, ŵane mungulugulu Lusulo lwa Haboli m'boma ja Gosani, nipo ŵane ŵaŵisile ku misinda ja Amedi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Msinda ŵa Samaliya wajonasice camti myiyi, ligongo lyakuti ŵandu ŵa ku Isalaeli, ŵalemwecesye AMBUJE Mlungu jwawo, juŵakopwesye ku cilambo ca Iguputo, kwatyosya m'magasa mwa Mwenye jwa ku Iguputo. Ŵaliji mkupopela milungu ja cilendo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŵaliji mkukuya misyungu ja ŵandu ŵa mitundu jine,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " jiŵajitopwesye AMBUJE ndaŵi jiŵayikaga Aisalaeli mcilambomo. Ŵaliji mkukuya soni misyungu jine ja cilendo jiŵajitandisye ayimwene ŵane ŵa ku Isalaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aisalaeliwo ŵatesile yindu yine yele AMBUJE Mlungu jwawo nganasangalala nayo. Ŵataŵile malo gakulambila milungu ja cilendo m'misinda jawo josope, kutandila msinda wawunondi mpaka mu msinda wawukulungwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵataŵile soni yipilala ya maganga yayilewulewu, ŵagumbile yitusitusi ya mlungu jwawo Ashela, pacanya pa matumbi ni kusi kwa yitela yagudulila masamba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.14.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ayi 14:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵanduwo ŵaliji mkutaga mbopesi ni kututumisya ubani",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " mgele malogo, mpela mwele muŵatendelaga ŵandu ŵa mitundu jine, jiŵajitopwesye AMBUJE ndaŵi jiŵayikaga Aisalaeli mcilambomo. Ŵatumbilisye AMBUJE pakutenda yele yindu ya kusakala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pakutenda yele yinduyi ŵalemwecesye AMBUJE pangapikanila yiŵalamwile akayitenda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE ŵatumisye ŵakulocesya ni ŵamitenga ŵawo ku cilambo ca Isalaeli ni ca ku Yuda kuja kulalicila aga maloŵega, “Mlece ndamo syenu syakusakala, ni mgapikanile malamusi gangu ginapelece kwa acinangolo ŵenu, kupitila mwa ŵakutumicila ŵangu, ŵakulocesya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo Aisalaeli nganapikanila gombelesya kwa AMBUJE, ŵaliji ŵambapata mpela acinangolo ŵawo ŵaŵakanile kwakulupilila AMBUJE Mlungu ŵawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jemanjajo ŵaganyosisye Malamusi ga AMBUJE ni cilanga ca AMBUJE ciŵapangene ni acinangolo ŵawo. Soni nganakupikanila kugombelesya kwa AMBUJE. Ŵajikuyiye milungu ja cilendo, nipo jemanjajo ŵasandwice ŵandu ŵangalumbana. Ŵaliji mkukuya ndamo syangajenela sya ŵandu ŵa mitundu jine, ŵaŵatamaga nawo mwakuŵandikana mcilambomo, atamose kuti AMBUJE ŵaliji ali ŵagombelesye kuti akasajigalila ndamo syakusakala sya ŵandu ŵa cilendowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo ŵakasile malamusi gosope ga AMBUJE Mlungu ŵawo, ni ŵapanganyisye milungu jagumba ni cisyano, ja ŵanace ŵa ng'ombe ŵaŵili ŵa golidi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ŵapanganyisye Ashela mlungu jwagumba jwamkongwe, ni soni ŵasilambilanga ndondwa, ni milungu ja Baala",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.12.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ayi 12:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵatagaga mpela mbopesi ŵanace ŵawo ŵacalume ni ŵanace ŵawo ŵacakongwe. Ni ŵalondolaga yisango. Aisalaeli ŵalipelece kutenda cindu cilicose ciŵaciŵengaga AMBUJE, pakutenda myoyo jemanjajo ŵatumbilisye AMBUJE.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.18.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Det 18:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE ŵatumbilile mnope ŵandu ŵa ku Isalaeli, nipo ŵakundile kuti ajigalwe ukapolo kucilambo ca cilendo, nambo ŵalesile ŵandu ŵa cilambo ca Yuda kutama mcilambo cawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo nombe nawo ŵandu ŵa Ciyuda nganagasunga Malamusi ga AMBUJE Mlungu ŵawo, ŵajigalile misyungu jine jakusakala jiŵajitandisye ŵandu ŵa ku Isalaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo AMBUJE ŵalosisye ndungu ŵandu wosope ŵa Isalaeli, ŵasawisye, ni ŵapelece m'magasa mwa ŵandu ŵamagongo ŵawo ŵangalwe, mpaka ŵamasile kwatyosya Aisalaeli wosope, ni pangali juŵasigele mcilambo mwawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
