            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndaŵi jelejo AMBUJE ŵawulekangenye mtundu ŵa Isalaeli ŵa cilambo ca kumpoto, ni ŵandu ŵa liŵasa lya Daudi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ŵiŵaliji ku cilambo cakumwela, Aisalaeli ŵa kumpotowo ŵamsagwile Yelobowamu mwanace jwa Nebati kuŵa mwenye jwawo. Mwenye Yelobowamujo ŵalemwekasisye ŵandu ŵa ku Isalaeli, pakwalekasya jemanjajo kwalambila AMBUJE. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jemanjajo nganaleka kuyitenda yindu yosope ya kulemwa, yiŵayitesile Yelobowamu mwenye jwawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nganayileka kuyitenda yindu yeleyo, mpaka pambesi pakwe AMBUJE ŵatyosisye ŵandu wosope mcilambo mwawo ni ŵapelece m'magasa mwa amagongo ŵawo. Mpela muŵaŵecetele AMBUJE kupitila mwa ŵakulocesya, ŵandu ŵakutumicila ŵawo. Myoyo Aisalaeli ŵosope ŵajigalidwe ukapolo kutyoka ku cilambo ca kumangwawo kuja ku cilambo ca Asiliya, kwali ciŵela mkutama mpakana lelo jino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵa ku Asiliya akutamilicika ku Isalaeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye jwa ku Asiliya ŵayice ni ŵandu kutyocela ku misinda ja Babiloni,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Kyuta, Afa, Hamati ni Sefalafayimu, ni ŵatamice m'misinda ja mcilambo ca Samaliya, m'malo mwa Aisalaeli ŵaŵajigalidwe ukapolo. Nipo ŵanduwo ŵatemi m'misinda jatemiji Aisalaeliwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piŵayice jemanjaji mcilambo ca Aisalaeli, nganiŵalambilaga AMBUJE. Nipo AMBUJEWO ŵagatumisye masimba pasikati jawo, ni gawuleje ŵandu ŵane ŵa jemanjajo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpaka mwenye jwa ku Asiliya jwapikene kuti, “Ŵandu ŵimwajigele kuja kwatamika ku cilambo ca ku Samaliya ŵala, ngakumanyilila kumlambila kwakwe Mlungu jwa cele cilamboco. Myoyo Mlungu jwa cilamboco ŵatumicisye masimba pasikati pawo, nipo jili mkwawulaga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nipo mwenye jwa ku Asiliya ŵalamwile kuti, “Mumtumisye jumo jwa ŵakutaga mbopesi jutwamkamwile ukapolo, ajawule akatame kukoko, kuti akajiganye ŵele ŵanduwo matala gakumlambila Mlungu jwa cele cilamboco.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo ŵamsagwile jumo jwa ŵakutaga mbopesi jwa ci Isalaeli kuti awujile ku cilambo ca Isalaeli. Jwalakwe ŵajile kutama ku Beteli, kuŵaliji mkwajiganya ŵandu matala ga kwalambila AMBUJE.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo ŵandu ŵa cilendo ŵiŵatemi mcilambo ca Samaliya cila ŵapelengenye kupanganya milungu ja mtundu ŵawo jakugumba, ni ŵajiŵisile milungu jawojo m'malo gakulambila gaŵataŵile Aisalaeli. Mtundu uliwose ŵa ŵele ŵanduwo, ŵapanganyisye milungu malinga ni mtundu ŵawo m'misinda jiŵatamagajo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵa ku Babiloni ŵalipanganyicisye mlungu jwawo jwagumba lina lyakwe Sukoti Benoti. Ŵandu ŵa ku Kyuti, ŵalipanganyicisye mlungu jwagumba lina lyakwe Nelega. Ŵandu ŵa ku Hamati, ŵalipanganyicisye mlungu jwagumba lina lyakwe Ashima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵa ku Ifa, ŵalipanganyicisye mlungu jwagumba lina lyakwe Nibihasi ni Talitaki. Ŵandu ŵa ku Sefalafayimu, ŵaliji mkwataga ŵanace ŵawo mpela mbopesi jakutinisya, kwa milungu jawo ja kumangwawo ku Sefalafayimu jakolanjidwa ni mena gakuti Adilameleki ni Anameleki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵeleŵa soni ŵaliji mkwalambila AMBUJE, ni ŵasagwile ŵandu wamba pasikati pawo, kuti aŵe ŵakutaga mbopesi, ŵakutumicila kumalo gawo gakulambila milungu ja cilendo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo ŵaliji mkwalambila AMBUJE, nambo soni ŵaliji mkujilambila milungu jawo, pakuya misyungu ja kucilambo ciŵatyocele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jemanjajo ali ciŵela mkujisunga misyungu jawo jacikala mpaka lelo jino. Ngakwalambila AMBUJE, atamose kugapikanila majiganyo kapena malamusi giŵapelece AMBUJEWO kwa yisukulu ya Yakobo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " jwele juŵamkolasile soni kuti Isalaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.32.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gen 32:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.35.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "35:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE ŵatesile nawo Aisalaeli cilanga, ni ŵasalile kuti, “Mkasimjipopela milungu jine, kapena kujilambila, kapena kujitumicila, kapena kujitajila mbopesi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.20.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eks 20:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.5.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Det 5:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo mulambileje une AMBUJE, junamkopwesye kucilambo ca Iguputo ni mkono wangu wamacili ga makulungwa. Mundindiŵalileje une AMBUJE, soni mtajeje mbopesi kwa une jikape.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.6.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Det 6:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mkasimlambila milungu jine, nambo ndaŵi syosope mgapikanileje majiganyo ni malamusi gangu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ni soni mkaliŵalila cilanga cinatesile ni jemanja. Nguwilisya kumsalila kuti, mkalambila milungu jine, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nambo mulambileje une AMBUJE Mlungu jwenu, nipo une tinjimkulupusya kwa amagongo ŵenu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo ŵandu ŵaŵatamaga ku cilambo ca Isalaeli ŵala, nganagapikanila gele maloŵega, m'malo mwakwe ŵaliji mkupitilisya kutenda misyungu jawo jiŵatendaga citandilile kalakala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo mitundu ja ŵandu ŵeleŵa, ŵaliji mkwalambila AMBUJE, kwineku ali mkujitumicila milungu jawo ja cilendo ja cangalumbana jila. Ŵanaceŵawo ni yisukulu yawo ŵaliji mkulambila milungu ja cilendo, mpela muŵatendelaga acinangolo ŵawo ŵala. Akutendape yeleyi mpakana lelo jino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
